OL,3,GNEWSAFamily fundraise to create
OL,4,Ahospital quiet room
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a seven-year-old boy who
OL,7,Ffound his stay on a children's hospital
OL,8,Fward "overwhelming" are fundraising for
OL,9,Fa new quiet room.
OL,11,FBen, from Wells in Somerset, spent a
OL,12,Fweek at the Royal United Hospitals
OL,13,F(RUH) in Bath after he was diagnosed
OL,14,Fwith type 1 diabetes in April.
OL,16,FBen's family is aiming to raise #5,000
OL,17,Ftowards the development of a
OL,18,Fde-escalation room, which his mother
OL,19,FJaney said would be "a really good
OL,20,Faddition to the hospital".
OL,23,APub: 23-DecQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
